/-
# HC Gap L4 -- Front C138: Cartan image equals the boundary/source-H8 route (R703).

R702 connected the R646 Cartan-image containment route to the finite
trivial-multiplicity consumer.  R691 already used the explicit generator line
`span {j_q(h^4)}`, and R694 identified the preferred two-target route as

* honest `MatsushimaV56BoundaryData`;
* concrete source surjectivity `surjectivity_source = H8`.

This file closes the notation gap between those route surfaces.  The Cartan
image is exactly the line generated by `j_q(h^4)` (R656), so the R646/R702
Cartan-image contract is equivalent to the R691 generator-line contract.  The
same contract is also equivalent to the R694 boundary-data/source-H8 route.

No geometric target is proved here.  The remaining work is still the R694
two-target route: prove boundary data and prove source-H8 surjectivity.
-/

